## Quick start

```
{{python}} -m pip install -r requirements.txt
{{python}} scripts/parity.py init-db
{{python}} scripts/parity.py precheck
{{run_command}}
```

For a combined project, choose `--workflow compare` when creating mismatches from source and target data, or `--workflow ingest-diff` when analysing a mismatch report supplied by another tool.

Or, in VS Code Copilot Chat, pick the **{{project_name}} Orchestrator** agent and say "run comparison workflow" or "run supplied-report workflow" (or use the `/run-parity` prompt).

