## Project layout

```
config/            project.json, datasets.json, mappings/, filters.json, config.yaml, {{parity_config_file}}
rules/             known_discrepancies.json (single source of KD logic), custom_rules.py
input/ reference/  input files (git-ignored)
db/                local analysis DB (git-ignored)
output/            reports/, llm/<run_id>/, feedback/ (git-ignored)
scripts/parity.py  CLI for every stage
parity_core/       shared engine from the factory (do not edit; upgrade from the factory)
.github/           agents, skills, prompts, instructions for Copilot
docs/              USER_MANUAL.md, ANALYSIS_FLOW.md
```

See [docs/USER_MANUAL.md](docs/USER_MANUAL.md) for the full guide and [docs/ANALYSIS_FLOW.md](docs/ANALYSIS_FLOW.md) for the business logic.
